    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SAM: Oofta is as Oofta does.\nSAM: Just because we're colored don't mean we run on colored people time.\nCOCO: Boycotting hot combs don't make you an expert on \"colored people\" boo.",
      "SAM: You call me the minute there's an update. Love you too mom.\nCURLS: There is one other sister in my Relativity class, I'll be damned if our professor doesn't call me Laretta every God damn time.",
      "CURLS: Means to an end, sister.\nCOCO: The talented tenth always has to bust its ass a little bit harder, but I don't see the benefit in blaming white folks for everything.\nCURLS: Who's blaming?",
      "SAM: Dear White People, stop dancing.\nCOCO: The fuck?\nCOCO: Muffins. I hate to do it, but Imma have to get real Black with you. So the other day, a girl had the nerve to fix her mouth and ask me if my…\nCOCO: First of all if you're going to fix your mouth to ask me something like that, say it right please? It's weave. Noun. Present tense. Second o…",
      "SAM: Dear White People using Instagram. You have an iPhone and go on hikes. I get it.\nCOCO: Ugh."
    ]
  },
